---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund_over: sale has ended
    q_check_ended --> q_revert: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_refund_over --> q_check_not_published: refund period ended
    q_check_refund_over --> q_revert: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_results: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_set_results --> q_set_token: set claimMerkleRoot, excessMerkleRoot, totalTokensAllocated
    q_set_token --> [*]: set askToken address, emit ResultsPublished
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_set_results
        INV-001: askToken address set during results publication (pre-liquid, no TGE at init)
        INV-002: Merkle roots enable claim and excess withdrawal verification
        INV-003: totalTokensAllocated reflects project discretionary allocation
    end note
